    <title>Position Bias in Pairwise LLM Evaluation</title>
    <summary>  We show that LLM judges prefer whichever answer is presented first in
pairwise comparisons, and propose a simple swap-and-average correction.
</summary>
    <author>
      <name>Eve Sample</name>
